    "innovation": "This paper synthesizes paleoclimate evidence from early Cenozoic warming events, particularly the Palaeocene-Eocene Thermal Maximum, to demonstrate their use as analogues for understanding the potential climate and carbon-cycle responses to massive future anthropogenic greenhouse gas emissions.",
    "kg_extraction_triplets": [
